<title>UK: Brazil's CSN Iron sets $600 million 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Brazil's CSN Iron sets $600 million 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager JP Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CSN IRON SA</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  COMPANHIA SIDERURGICA NACIONAL</p>
<p> AMT    $600 MLN	COUPON     9.125     MATURITY    01.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.55     PAY DATE    26.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  60 BP     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-100     SALE LIMITS US/UK/BR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   GROSS UP</p>
<p> MGT/UND    20 BP     SELL CONC  40 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
